    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat is the retail price of one pack of glue sticks at the school-supply store? Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 28 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 6; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nWhat is the retail price of one pack of glue sticks at the school-supply store? Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 28 students.\"},{\"turn\":2,\"user_message\":\"Wait, I made a mistake. Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 27 students.\"},{\"turn\":3,\"user_message\":\"Oh, I forgot to mention: the glue sticks come in packs of 9.\"},{\"turn\":4,\"user_message\":\"Actually, that was wrong. The glue sticks come in packs of 8.\"},{\"turn\":5,\"user_message\":\"I should also tell you: the school-supply store sells each pack of glue sticks for $6.\"},{\"turn\":6,\"user_message\":\"Here's another detail: the store does not offer discounts on glue-stick packs.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Thanks, that helps. Now I want to figure out: How many packs of glue sticks does Mr. Jackson need to buy so every student can have 2 glue sticks? By the way, here are some relevant details: Mr. Jackson wants to give each student 2 glue sticks. Mr. Jackson can only buy whole packs and expects to have some extra glue sticks left over.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Mr. Jackson needs:\n\n1. \\(27 \\times 2 = 54\\) glue sticks.\n2. Each pack contains \\(8\\) glue sticks.\n3. \\(54 \\div 8 = 6.75\\), so he must buy \\(7\\) whole packs.\n\nSeven packs provide \\(7 \\times 8 = 56\\) glue sticks, leaving \\(2\\) extra.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{7\\text{ packs}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
